      "source": "Obtain a <code>ClientSession</code> bound instance of <a href=\"../MongoDatabaseFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>MongoDatabaseFactory</code></a> returning <code>MongoDatabase</code>\ninstances that are aware and bound to the given session.",
