    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"SimpleMongoClientDatabaseFactory.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core\"><code>SimpleMongoClientDatabaseFactory</code></a> instance from the given <code>MongoClient</code>. Note that the\nclient will not be closed when calling <a href=\"MongoDatabaseFactorySupport.html#destroy()\"><code>MongoDatabaseFactorySupport.destroy()</code></a> as we assume a managed client instance that we do not\nwant to close on <a href=\"MongoDatabaseFactorySupport.html#destroy()\"><code>MongoDatabaseFactorySupport.destroy()</code></a> meaning that you (or the application container) must dispose the client\ninstance once it is no longer required for use.",
      "translation": "根据给定的 <code>MongoClient</code> 创建一个新的 <a href=\"SimpleMongoClientDatabaseFactory.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core\"><code>SimpleMongoClientDatabaseFactory</code></a> 实例。请注意，调用 <a href=\"MongoDatabaseFactorySupport.html#destroy()\"><code>MongoDatabaseFactorySupport.destroy()</code></a> 时不会关闭该客户端，因为我们假设这是一个由外部管理的客户端实例，在调用 <a href=\"MongoDatabaseFactorySupport.html#destroy()\"><code>MongoDatabaseFactorySupport.destroy()</code></a> 时不需要将其关闭。因此，您（或应用程序容器）必须在不再需要该客户端实例时负责对其进行释放。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"SimpleMongoClientDatabaseFactory.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core\"><code>SimpleMongoClientDatabaseFactory</code></a> instance for the given <code>connectionString</code>. Using this\nconstructor will create a new <code>MongoClient</code> instance that will be closed when calling <a href=\"MongoDatabaseFactorySupport.html#destroy()\"><code>MongoDatabaseFactorySupport.destroy()</code></a>.",
      "translation": "为给定的 <code>connectionString</code> 创建一个新的 <a href=\"SimpleMongoClientDatabaseFactory.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core\"><code>SimpleMongoClientDatabaseFactory</code></a> 实例。使用此构造函数将创建一个新的 <code>MongoClient</code> 实例，该实例在调用 <a href=\"MongoDatabaseFactorySupport.html#destroy()\"><code>MongoDatabaseFactorySupport.destroy()</code></a> 时会被关闭。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"SimpleMongoClientDatabaseFactory.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core\"><code>SimpleMongoClientDatabaseFactory</code></a> instance from the given <code>MongoClient</code>. Using this\nconstructor will create a new <code>MongoClient</code> instance that will be closed when calling <a href=\"MongoDatabaseFactorySupport.html#destroy()\"><code>MongoDatabaseFactorySupport.destroy()</code></a>.",
      "translation": "根据给定的 <code>MongoClient</code> 创建一个新的 <a href=\"SimpleMongoClientDatabaseFactory.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core\"><code>SimpleMongoClientDatabaseFactory</code></a> 实例。使用此构造函数将创建一个全新的 <code>MongoClient</code> 实例，该实例在调用 <a href=\"MongoDatabaseFactorySupport.html#destroy()\"><code>MongoDatabaseFactorySupport.destroy()</code></a> 时会被关闭。",
      "count": 1
    },
